 "remarks": "Recently refreshed and available for immediate occupancy! Located in the desirable Park Towers Condominium Association along Norwalk's historic town green, home to seasonal festivals, concerts and farmers markets, this spacious 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom ground-level residence offers approximately 1,056 SF of living space. A generous living and dining area features new carpeting and abundant natural light, complemented by ample storage throughout. This well-managed complex offers an elevator, on-site laundry and ample parking for residents and guests. Ideally situated for commuters with easy access to I-95, the Merritt Parkway, East Norwalk Train Station and local bus routes. Enjoy close proximity to SoNo's vibrant dining and nightlife, schools and premier shopping at The SoNo Collection. Moments from all that Norwalk has to offer! No pets or smoking. Security deposit and strong credit required.",
